.TH "CSDLC-FOUNDATION" "1" "September 11, 2026" "C-SDLC v3" "ADL Operator Manual"
.SH NAME
csdlc\-foundation \- inspect retained foundation contract
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&csdlc foundation \-\-repo\-root ROOT
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Reads docs/csdlc\-v3 foundation contract, predecessor coverage and proportional lifecycle inputs; produces static construction classification. It does not grant current authority or create lifecycle state.
.SH OPTIONS
\&\-\-repo\-root: Explicit repository discovery root. Required by foundation/sprint; optional for local\-family commands. It does not override authenticated binding guards.
.PP
\&\-\-help: Show standalone help; \-h is equivalent.
.PP
\&\-h: Show standalone help; do not combine with execution options.
.SH REQUEST
\&No JSON request.
.SH EFFECTS
\&Observation or static model only. Read findings/status, not just process exit status; no release or lifecycle activation authority is granted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&csdlc foundation \-\-repo\-root .
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\&csdlc(1), csdlc\-requests(1).
